<title>USA: Apartment Investment in $50.3 mln offering.</title>
<headline>Apartment Investment in $50.3 mln offering.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apartment Investment and Management Co said on Thursday it is offering two million Class A common shares to the public at $26.75, to raise $50.3 million to reduce acquisition-related debt.</p>
<p>With the offering, Apartment Investment will have 20.4 million shares outstanding. The underwriters are Smith Barney Inc, Alex. Brown &amp; Sons Inc, Robertson Stephens &amp; Co and Robinson-Humphrey Co Inc.</p>
</text>
